	Register(KeyW4AssistantOnlyTheSectionIsDeletedAndEveryMember, "只删除分组，所有成员移至未分组；不删除 Bot、群聊或历史。成功后可撤销。", "Only the section is deleted and every member moves to unassigned; Bots, groups and history are untouched. The action can be undone after it succeeds.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantTheHostWritesTheRoomCatalogEntryAndA, "Host 将写入群聊目录与审计记录，创建 dshbot-room 专属会话并打开它；可能启动相关会话生命周期处理。群聊后续使用成员 Bot 的模型/工具，可能产生费用或外部消息。本次不发送讨论提示词、不运行群聊。非空 workspace 优先于 scratch cwd。", "The Host writes the room catalog entry and audit record, creates and opens the dshbot-room dedicated session, and may start related session lifecycle handling. The group later uses member Bots' models and tools, which may incur costs or send external messages. This save sends no discussion prompt and does not run the group. A non-empty workspace takes precedence over the scratch cwd.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantACatalogEntryDoesNotProveTheSessionW, "目录存在不证明会话已成功建立；采用后再打开会核实或恢复会话，不调用 bot/create。", "A catalog entry does not prove the session was created; adopting and opening it verifies or resumes the session without calling bot/create.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantTheCreationOutcomeIsUnknownTheLocalDr, "创建结果未知：本地草稿与身份保持锁定，不自动重试。即使读回没找到记录也不重建；Host 没有请求幂等保证。关闭界面不取消已发送操作，本地保护只在当前应用进程保留。", "The creation outcome is unknown: the local draft and identity stay locked with no automatic retry. A read-back without a record does not rebuild it either, because the Host offers no request idempotency guarantee. Closing the view does not cancel what was sent, and the local guard lives only in this process.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantEditTheSelectedGroupSNameFullDescript, "编辑已选群聊的名称、完整说明，以及原有成员顺序和限额。工作区、头像及其他资料保持原样；没有独立 title 输入。", "Edit the selected group's name, full description, existing member order and limits. The workspace, avatar and other data stay as they are, and there is no separate title field.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantDangerousActionDeletesThisGroupSCatalo, "危险操作：删除本群聊目录资料，删除归属于这个 room ID 的例行任务及 notepad 整个文件，取消涉及此 room ID 的未完成任务，并从存活资料的 inbox 清理相关任务/例行任务记录；追加审计且最多保留 200 条。成员 Bot 目录保留，不删除成员 Bot；成员各自 canonical 会话保留，本群隐藏的成员会话也完整保留。仅释放本群 canonical presentation，不释放本群隐藏成员会话的 presentation。Host 会中止本群当前成员轮次、推进轮次 epoch 并尝试取消群代理；这些运行影响可能发生在后续目录写入失败之前。notepad 直接删除、无回收站或 Undo；其执行时当前全部内容可能不可恢复。保留 history 和 bot/user memory 不保证可恢复，不能恢复已删群配置、例行任务、任务状态、inbox、审计修剪或 notepad。预览与删除非原子、未共用同一锁：动态任务/inbox/notepad 可继续变化，Host 按执行时当前关联状态处理。失败仅尝试恢复 presentation，不承诺全部回滚；未知回包不代表无副作用，禁止自动重试。", "Dangerous action: deletes this group's catalog data, deletes every routine and the whole notepad file that belong to this room ID, cancels unfinished tasks tied to this room ID, and cleans related task and routine records out of surviving inboxes; an audit entry is appended and at most 200 are kept. Member Bot catalog entries are kept and member Bots are not deleted; each member keeps its canonical session, and member sessions hidden by this group are preserved in full. Only this group's canonical presentation is released, not the presentation of its hidden member sessions. The Host aborts current member turns for this group, advances the turn epoch and tries to cancel the group agent; those runtime effects may happen before a later catalog write fails. The notepad is deleted directly with no recycle bin or Undo, and all of its content at execution time may be unrecoverable. Keeping history and bot/user memory does not guarantee recovery of the deleted group configuration, routines, task states, inboxes, trimmed audit records or the notepad. Preview and deletion are not atomic and share no lock: live tasks, inboxes and the notepad can keep changing and the Host acts on the current association at execution time. On failure only the presentation is restored and no full rollback is promised; an unknown response does not mean there were no side effects, so never retry automatically.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantUsesTheHostDefaultAvatarGroupModelFie, "使用 Host 默认头像；群聊模型字段为空，tools/skills/MCP 为全部，allowedSenderIds 为空，无目标或例行任务。创建结果未知时保留并锁定草稿，仅只读核对，不自动重试；打开失败与创建失败分开处理。", "Uses the Host default avatar; group model fields are empty, tools/skills/MCP are all, allowedSenderIds is empty, and there is no objective or routine. When the creation outcome is unknown the draft is kept and locked, only read-only checks are allowed and nothing is retried automatically; an open failure is handled separately from a creation failure.")
