	Register(KeyW4AssistantChoose26RealBotsFromTheCurrentHostC, "从当前 Host 目录选择 2–6 个真实 Bot，创建群聊资料和专属会话。这里只创建群聊，不编辑现有群组或直接运行讨论。", "Choose 2–6 real Bots from the current Host catalog to create the group entry and its dedicated session. This only creates a group; it does not edit existing groups or run a discussion.")
