	Register(KeyW4AssistantThisCallsTheOriginalBotTriggerTokenAn, "此操作调用原版 bot/trigger-token：已有凭据会返回，缺失时会创建并保存持久凭据。凭据按此 Host 的 Bot 目录共享，并非单个任务专属；持有者且能访问该 Host 触发端点，可触发该目录其他已知任务 ID，包括暂停任务，可能执行工具、发送外部消息并产生模型费用。手动触发会跳过 watch 检查，仍受 Host 忙碌/次数限制。", "This calls the original bot/trigger-token: an existing credential is returned and a missing one is created and stored as a persistent credential. The credential is shared across this Host's Bot catalog rather than being task-specific; anyone who holds it and can reach that Host's trigger endpoint can trigger other known task IDs in the catalog, including paused tasks, which may run tools, send external messages and incur model costs. A manual trigger skips the watch check but is still subject to Host busy and rate limits.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantDefaultsTo0900DailyTheHostSchedulesI, "默认每日 09:00；按所填时区由 Host 调度，实际下次时间以 Host 返回为准。", "Defaults to 09:00 daily; the Host schedules it in the time zone you enter, and its answer decides the actual next run.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantShowsOnlyDelegatedTasksThisBotSentOr, "仅显示所选 Bot 发出或收到的委派任务；刷新读取当前 Host，操作由你确认后执行。", "Shows only delegated tasks this Bot sent or received; refresh reads the current Host and actions run after you confirm them.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantASensitiveSharedCredentialShownOnlyTem, "敏感共享凭据，仅本页临时显示。复制鉴权头会进入系统剪贴板，可能被历史/同步记录；本应用清除显示不会清除系统剪贴板。", "A sensitive shared credential, shown only temporarily on this page. Copying the authorization header puts it on the system clipboard, which history or sync may record; clearing this view does not clear the system clipboard.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantTheConfirmationBindsToTheCurrentlyAuth, "确认绑定当前已认证 Host 连接和目录账号；账号或连接变化会使确认失效。原版没有独立只读获取、rotate 或 revoke 接口。关闭本页只清除显示，不撤销 Host 上的凭据。", "The confirmation binds to the currently authenticated Host connection and catalog account; a change of account or connection invalidates it. The original has no separate read-only, rotate or revoke endpoint. Closing this page only clears the display and does not revoke the credential on the Host.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantTheDayOfMonthYouEnter131DefaultingT, "每月所填日期（1–31），默认 1 日 09:00；月末与夏令时按 Host 解析，实际下次时间以 Host 返回为准。", "The day of month you enter (1–31), defaulting to the 1st at 09:00; the Host resolves month-end and daylight saving, and its answer decides the actual next run.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantTheWeekdayYouChooseDefaultingToMonday, "每周所选日，默认周一 09:00；依填写时区由 Host 调度，实际下次时间以 Host 返回为准。", "The weekday you choose, defaulting to Monday 09:00; the Host schedules it in the time zone you enter, and its answer decides the actual next run.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantMondayToFridayDefaultingTo0900TheHos, "周一至周五，默认 09:00；依填写时区由 Host 调度，不在本机推算夏令时变化。", "Monday to Friday, defaulting to 09:00; the Host schedules it in the time zone you enter and this app does not compute daylight saving locally.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantDefaultsToEvery1hWholeNumberMHDFrom, "默认每 1h；整数 m/h/d，范围 1 分钟至 365 天。启用后按间隔重复执行，0 次数上限表示不限；实际下次时间以 Host 返回为准。", "Defaults to every 1h; whole-number m/h/d from 1 minute to 365 days. Once enabled it repeats at that interval and a cap of 0 means unlimited; the Host's answer decides the actual next run.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantDefaultsToA30mDelayWholeNumberMHDF, "默认延迟 30m；整数 m/h/d，范围 1 分钟至 365 天。启用后由 Host 安排一次执行；实际下次时间以 Host 返回为准。", "Defaults to a 30m delay; whole-number m/h/d from 1 minute to 365 days. Once enabled the Host schedules a single run, and its answer decides the actual time.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantFiveFieldOrderMinuteHourDayMonthWeekd, "五字段顺序：分钟 小时 日 月 星期。这里只检查结构；确认保存时由 Host 验证完整 Cron 语法。月末、夏令时和实际下次时间以 Host 返回为准。", "Five-field order: minute hour day month weekday. Only the shape is checked here; the Host validates full Cron syntax when you confirm the save. Month-end, daylight saving and the actual next run follow the Host.")
