	Register(KeyW4AssistantReadingAndSavingAffectOnlyTheCurrentH, "读取、保存只作用于当前 Host 的鲸鱼娘；刷新保留未保存草稿，不会调用模型。", "Reading and saving affect only the current Host's Whale; refreshing keeps unsaved drafts and never calls a model.")
