	Register(KeyW4AssistantCreatesANewTaskAttemptAndWakesTheRec, "会创建新的任务尝试并唤醒接收 Bot，可能再次执行工具或产生模型费用。原任务保留。", "Creates a new task attempt and wakes the receiving Bot, which may run tools again or incur model costs. The original task is kept.")
