	Register(KeyW4AssistantTheDefaultModelForHerOwnSessionAfter, "她自身会话的默认模型；保存后 Host 同步已有常驻会话。留空跟随会话默认。", "The default model for her own session; after saving, the Host syncs the existing resident session. Leave empty to follow the session default.")
