	Register(KeyW4AssistantStopsThisBotSCurrentSessionForAGroup, "会停止此 Bot 的当前会话（群组会停止成员轮次）；保留 inbox，不取消全部委派任务，也不撤销已发生的操作。", "Stops this Bot's current session (for a group, the member turns); the inbox is kept, other delegated tasks are not cancelled and completed operations are not undone.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantThisReplacesTheWholeFileForThisTrack, "这会替换当前轨的整轨文件，影响此 Bot 后续使用的记忆；不会修改另一轨或启动 Bot，也不会撤销当前会话已读取的快照。空内容会删除该轨文件，移除内容不能自动恢复。", "This replaces the whole file for this track and changes the memory this Bot uses later; it does not touch the other track, start the Bot or undo snapshots the current session already read. Empty content deletes the track file, and removed content cannot be restored automatically.")
