	Register(KeyW4AssistantTheBotAndUserTracksOfTheSelectedBot, "当前 Host、所选 Bot 的 bot/user 两轨。读取和保存不会启动 Bot；刷新保留同身份草稿，不会自动覆盖或重试。", "The bot and user tracks of the selected Bot on the current Host. Reading and saving never start the Bot, and refresh keeps same-identity drafts without overwriting or retrying.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantTheHostReturnedNoValidMemoryreviewNoD, "Host 未返回有效 memoryReview；不补默认值，请使用现有 Bot Web 入口", "The Host returned no valid memoryReview; no default is filled in, so use the existing Bot Web entry")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantManagesTheOriginalMemoryreviewSettingA, "管理原版 memoryReview 配置。达到 Host 完成轮数阈值（默认 10，范围 1–100）或开始压缩时尝试后台检查；按事件触发，不创建例行任务。本页不推断当前生效阈值或后台健康状态。", "Manages the original memoryReview setting. A background review is attempted when the Host's completed-turn threshold is reached (default 10, range 1–100) or compaction starts; it is event-driven and creates no routine. This page does not infer the effective threshold or background health.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantUsesTheOriginalEntrySerializationTrimmi, "沿用原版条目序列化：去掉每项首尾空白，使用 - 前缀重新组成全文；原始非条目行和格式也将被以下内容替换。请核对完整前后内容。", "Uses the original entry serialization: trimming each item and rebuilding the text with - prefixes; original non-entry lines and formatting are replaced by the content below. Review the full before and after.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantReviewThisCatalogBotSFullConfiguration, "请先核对这个目录 Bot 的全部配置与目标。明确打开可能恢复会话、执行目标、调用工具并产生费用或消息；原复制结果仍保持未知。", "Review this catalog Bot's full configuration and objective first. Opening explicitly may resume the session, run the objective, call tools and incur costs or messages; the original copy outcome remains unknown.")
	Register(KeyW4AssistantTheCopyOutcomeStaysUnknownAndCannotBe, "复制结果保持未知，不能重发。Host 自行生成新身份：同配置的新记录也不能证明来自本次请求。候选仅供人工核对，打开候选不会解除原 attempt 的未知状态；记忆复制状态同样未知。保护只保留在本应用进程。", "The copy outcome stays unknown and cannot be resent. The Host generates new identities itself, so a new record with the same configuration does not prove it came from this request. Candidates are for manual review only, and opening one does not clear the original attempt's unknown state; memory copy state is equally unknown. The guard lives only in this process.")
